WEBVTT

00:00:59.055 --> 00:01:00.932
you’re not going to believe this --

00:01:00.932 --> 00:01:04.602
when my 7th grade teacher told me,

00:01:04.602 --> 00:01:07.063
“Why are you working so hard in math?

00:01:07.313 --> 00:01:09.357
You should be getting a boyfriend!”

00:01:09.732 --> 00:01:10.733
(Audience boos)

00:01:14.403 --> 00:01:17.824
But worse, it offended
my sense of fairness.

00:01:18.366 --> 00:01:20.743
Surely girls could have adventures too.

00:01:22.995 --> 00:01:24.122
So what could I do?

00:01:24.997 --> 00:01:27.375
I sat down with my spiral notebook

00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:29.085
and I rewrote the story.

00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:30.253
(Laughter)